      .. carousel-content:: IP Protection
         :nested:
         :doc: /doc/commercial

         IP Protection / Performance / Python

         Three pillars make Nuitka the best platform to deploy your
         application: IP Protection for commercial users, Performance for
         every program, and Python compatibility you can rely on.

         Protecting your IP is critical to your business success. Do not
         allow competitors, malicious clients, or exploiting customers to
         easily steal your work. **Nuitka Commercial** offers a full array
         of tools that make Python the best platform to deploy your
         application.

         .. grid:: 1 1 2 3
            :gutter: 1

            .. grid-item-card::  Binary Program

               No source code, no bytecode - only a compiled binary that
               cannot be easily reversed.

            .. grid-item-card::  Data Obfuscated

               Program constants and data are obfuscated so they are not
               readable in the compiled program.

            .. grid-item-card::  Data Files Inside

               Your data files are embedded as part of the program
               constants and protected that way.

            .. grid-item-card::  Encrypted Outputs

               Tracebacks and program outputs are encrypted, so only you
               can decode them.

            .. grid-item-card::  Commercial Features

               Exclusive commercial-only features and plugins on top of
               the standard Nuitka offering.

         Protect your IP now

